---
// src/tools/finance/split/About.astro
import { AccordionCard } from '@/core/components/ui';
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
  
  <AccordionCard title="How to use this tool" defaultOpen={true} client:load>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mt-2">
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1">1</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Set Up the Group</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Add your friends to the group list. You can easily switch between them by clicking their name.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1">2</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Add Expenses</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Select a person, enter what they paid for, and the amount. The tool automatically splits it among the whole group.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1">3</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Review & Share</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">The tool instantly calculates the minimum transactions needed to settle debts. Copy the text or download the receipt image to share.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </AccordionCard>

  <AccordionCard title="Project Overview" client:load>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Bill Splitter is a fully client-side expense sharing utility. It helps you split bills and expenses fairly with friends without needing any signup or server uploads.
    </p>
    <p>
      It uses a greedy algorithm to minimize the number of transactions required to settle all debts. Everything is stored locally on your device for 7 days.
    </p>
  </AccordionCard>

  <AccordionCard title="Under the hood (Architecture)" client:load>
    <p class="mb-4">
      This tool leverages a modern, lightweight architecture optimized for performance:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4 text-sm">
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Framework:</strong> Astro & React with Tailwind CSS.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">State:</strong> Zustand with LocalStorage persistence (auto-wipes after 7 days).</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Math:</strong> Custom greedy algorithm for debt settlement.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Image Export:</strong> SnapDOM for pixel-perfect, high-resolution receipt generation.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Zero backend. Zero API keys. Just pure, local computation.
    </p>
  </AccordionCard>

</div>